# torchbox

A PyTorch + OpenCV project.

## Usage

```bash
python3 -m torchbox --name Ryan
# or, once installed:
torchbox --name Ryan
```

## Development

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
pytest
ruff check .
```
